{"games":[{"id":98132581894671,"name":"[UPDATE] Conquest: Napoleonic Wars [Pre-Alpha]","desc":"Conquest: Napoleonic Wars is a real time strategy (RTS) game based on the Napoleonic era, inspired by Napoleon Total War and a successor to Conquest by captainwoodlegs. \n\nKeybinds\nR = Rotate units\nZ = Show units range\nH = toggle march at same speed\nX = ping\nC = halt selected units\nQ = select all the units\nE = deselect all selected units\nLeft control = see all the units goals positions without having them selected\nLeft control and click on an unit = select units without deselect.\nT + click = move units into a line automatically\nShift + click = move all the selected units in formation rather than all to the same place\nShift + click a unit = selecting all the units of the same type\nShift + press a number = select all units of the same type\n\nMOBILE \nDouble tap and hold = dragging to select multiple units at once\n\nUse /private in your own private server to open or close the servers settings UI\nUse /unstuck if ur character cant move","path":"/game/98132581894671-update-conquest-napoleonic-wars-pre-alpha","slug":"98132581894671-update-conquest-napoleonic-wars-pre-alpha","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9b2e64d025fa95792fc77e90cb1372b6d26b00885d14fe05e2950c57032675f9.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e783896bac7bc1f0cae64a47efe9485/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":21,"visitor":5331912,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-31T23:45:22.303Z","creator":{"name":"Conquest: Community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":139571938533204,"name":"Baltic Sea Simulator [MAP UPDATE!] │ALPHA","desc":"🚢 Set Sail in Baltic Sea Ship Simulator! Start your journey with a small vessel and work your way up to commanding an impressive fleet of ferries, general cargo, container, bulk carriers, cruise ships, and more! 🌊\nHaul cargo, transport passengers, earn money, and explore ports across the 